al Fantasy II. In addition, it does not have a Magic Point-based system for spell-casting. Instead, magic is collected, drawn, and created from items, and is used to power up the characters via the junction system.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/final-fantasy-viii", "videos": [{"id": 321, "name": "Commercial", "video_id": "u49xPK3QOl8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u49xPK3QOl8", "title": "Final Fantasy VIII / 8 official trailer 1", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/u49xPK3QOl8/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 155475, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "pvXPcyhIjHA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pvXPcyhIjHA", "title": "Final Fantasy VIII DEMO - PSX / PS1 - 16:9 Widescreen", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/pvXPcyhIjHA/sddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 155476, "name": "Game Intro", "video_id": "ISEmDowiyZQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ISEmDowiyZQ", "title": "Final Fantasy VIII PS1 Opening & Intro (USA)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ISEmDowiyZQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 162513, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "bFvkzoaOHUU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bFvkzoaOHUU", "title": "CM Final Fantasy VIII (\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30ca\u30eb\u30d5\u30a1\u30f3\u30bf\u30b8\u30fcVIII)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/bFvkzoaOHUU/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 162514, "name": "Dev Diary", "video_id": "NsIIvHaX5QY"}, {"id": 162515, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "dixx8iTREMg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dixx8iTREMg", "title": "PSX Longplay [006] Final Fantasy VIII (part 1 of 4)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/dixx8iTREMg/sddefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 39, "name": "Final Fantasy"}]}